{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000005","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000005"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000005","label":"風后","status":"active","historicity":"legendary_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"風后","mention_ids":["c-shiji-001-wudi:m003-0114","c-shiji-012-wudi:m049-0015"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m003-0114","chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p003","quote":"風后"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m049-0015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:p049","quote":"風后"}],"identity_note":"僅依本篇上下文建立；不因同名自動跨篇合併。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m003-0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"風后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000005","status":"source_identified","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p003","chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m049-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"風后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000005","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:p049","chapter_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji012-013","person_id":"cbr-p000005","surfaces":["風后"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-001-wudi","c-shiji-012-wudi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p003","quote":"東至于海，登丸山，及岱宗。西至于空桐，登雞頭。南至于江，登熊、湘。北逐葷粥，合符釜山，而邑于涿鹿之阿。遷徙往來無常處，以師兵爲營衞。官名皆以雲命，爲雲師。置左右大監，監于萬國。萬國和，而鬼神山川封禪與爲多焉。獲寶鼎，迎日推筴。舉風后、力牧、常先、大鴻以治民。順天地之紀、幽明之占、死生之說、存亡之難。時播百穀草木，淳化鳥獸蟲蛾，旁羅日月星辰水波土石金玉，勞勤心力耳目，節用水火材物。有土德之瑞，故號黃帝。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:p049","quote":"公玊帶曰：「黃帝時雖封泰山，然風后、封鉅、岐伯令黃帝封東泰山，禪凡山合符，然後不死焉。」天子既令設祠具，至東泰山，東泰山卑小，不稱其聲，乃令祠官禮之，而不封禪焉。其後令帶奉祠候神物。夏，遂還泰山，修五年之禮如前，而加禪祠石閭。石閭者，在泰山下阯南方，方士多言此僊人之閭也，故上親禪焉。"}],"rationale":"依本篇封禪、方士、授官與神異引語的明示語境判讀異稱；神祇或傳說不轉為已確證生平，跨篇同指仍待版本與專門研究核對。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p003","text":"東至于海，登丸山，及岱宗。西至于空桐，登雞頭。南至于江，登熊、湘。北逐葷粥，合符釜山，而邑于涿鹿之阿。遷徙往來無常處，以師兵爲營衞。官名皆以雲命，爲雲師。置左右大監，監于萬國。萬國和，而鬼神山川封禪與爲多焉。獲寶鼎，迎日推筴。舉風后、力牧、常先、大鴻以治民。順天地之紀、幽明之占、死生之說、存亡之難。時播百穀草木，淳化鳥獸蟲蛾，旁羅日月星辰水波土石金玉，勞勤心力耳目，節用水火材物。有土德之瑞，故號黃帝。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m003-0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"風后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000005","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m003-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"力牧","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000006","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m003-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"常先","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000007","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m003-0123","start":123,"end":125,"surface":"大鴻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000008","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m003-0199","start":199,"end":201,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000001","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-001","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-001-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:p049","text":"公玊帶曰：「黃帝時雖封泰山，然風后、封鉅、岐伯令黃帝封東泰山，禪凡山合符，然後不死焉。」天子既令設祠具，至東泰山，東泰山卑小，不稱其聲，乃令祠官禮之，而不封禪焉。其後令帶奉祠候神物。夏，遂還泰山，修五年之禮如前，而加禪祠石閭。石閭者，在泰山下阯南方，方士多言此僊人之閭也，故上親禪焉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m049-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"公玊帶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001007","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m049-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000001","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m049-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"風后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000005","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m049-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"封鉅","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001010","status":"contextual_provis